				<p>TERMS AND CONDITIONS – FACEBANK VISA PLATINUM CREDIT CARD</p>
<p>Interest Rates and Interest Charges</p>
<p>Annual Percentage Rate (APR) for Purchases 25.00% APR</p>
<p>Annual Percentage Rate (APR) for Cash Advances and Balance Transfers 25.00% APR</p>
<p>Penalty Rate No Penalty APR is charged on the Credit Card product.</p>
<p>Payment of Interest The due date for each payment is at least 25 days after the close of each billing cycle. No interest charges will be imposed on purchases during billing periods with no previous balance, provided that the entire account balance, including purchases made during that period, is paid or credited on or before the applicable due date. If you pay your full balance on or before the monthly due date, no interest will be charged on purchases. For cash advances and balance transfers, interest will accrue from the date of the transaction.</p>
<p>Federal Reserve Board Recommendations on Credit Cards For more information about factors to consider when applying for or using a credit card, visit the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau page: https://www.consumerfinance.gov/data-research/credit-card-data/</p>
<p>Other Charges</p>
<p>Membership Fee $150.00 Annual Fee, $75.00 Additional Card Fee (if applicable).</p>
<p>International Transaction Fee 3% of the amount of each transaction in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>Cash Advance Fees 3% of each transaction (Minimum $2, Maximum $50).</p>
<p>Late Payment Fee Up to $35.00 for payments received after the cycle closing date.</p>
<p>How Your Balance is Calculated We use the “average daily balance (including new purchases)” method. Please refer to your Credit Card Agreement for more details.</p>
<p>Information on credit card costs is accurate as of January 1, 2021. This information may have changed since that date. To verify any changes, you may call 1-877-979-FACE (3223), 787-705-7641, 787-749-0051, email <a href="mailto:servicios@facebank.pr">servicios@facebank.pr</a>, or write to:</p>
<p>FaceBank International Corp. Metro Office Park 17 Calle 2, Suite 600 Guaynabo, PR 00968</p>
<p>Important Notice – U.S.A. PATRIOT ACT Effective October 1, 2003, Section 326 of the USA PATRIOT Act requires financial institutions to obtain, verify, and record information that identifies persons who open accounts. This law was created to combat terrorism and money laundering.</p>
<p>When opening an account: – You will be asked for your name, residential or physical address, date of birth, Social Security number, and other information to verify your identity. – You will be required to show a valid government-issued photo ID.</p>
<p>Information collected by FaceBank International Corp. will be kept confidential as required by the Privacy Act.</p>
<p>Retail Installment Agreement – Revolving Account Plan The following terms and conditions govern the use of VISA credit cards issued by FaceBank International Corporation Puerto Rico (the Bank) by the applicant (the Cardholder), individually or jointly:</p>
<p>I. CARD USAGE The Cardholder will use the card to purchase or lease goods or services at establishments that accept the card and to obtain cash advances from the Bank or any bank accepting the card, within limits set by the Bank. The Cardholder authorizes the Bank to pay and charge to the account all purchases, cash advances, and any Additional Card charges, plus interest and any other applicable fees.</p>
<ol>
<li>CREDIT LIMIT The initial credit limit granted by the Bank will appear on the Virtual Banking screen upon confirmation of the credit card application and on the card portal. The Bank may reduce the credit limit for reasons including misuse, inactivity for 12 months, or failure to activate the account.</li>
<li>CARD CANCELLATION You may cancel your account at any time by notifying the Bank in writing. The Bank may cancel or revoke the card at any time, with or without cause, and without prior notice.</li>
<li>MONTHLY STATEMENT The Bank will provide a monthly statement containing all legally required information.</li>
</ol>
<p>V. INTEREST CHARGES Interest charges on “VISA PLATINUM” cards apply only to the principal balance on purchases, services, cash advances, and balance transfers. The computation is based on the rates below:</p>
