<p>Interest on purchases is calculated using the average daily balance method, adding new purchases and subtracting payments/credits received. Cash advances accrue interest immediately.</p>
<ol>
<li>MINIMUM PAYMENT The Cardholder must pay at least 3.5% of the outstanding balance or $25, whichever is greater. Payments will first cover interest, then the remainder will apply proportionally to purchases and cash advances.</li>
<li>VII.PAYMENT APPLICATION Payments are applied first to interest charges; any excess payment applies to the most onerous debt.</li>
<li>VIII.ANNUAL MEMBERSHIP FEE The Cardholder is responsible for an annual membership fee for the primary and any additional cards. Fees apply even if cards are not used.</li>
</ol>
